        "Suffix model interfaces with \"Model\" (e.g., UserDetailsModel, TicketListItemModel)",
        "Suffix props interfaces with \"Props\" (e.g., PrimaryTextFormFieldProps)",
        "Never use any - use proper typing or unknown",
        "Use optional chaining (?. ) and nullish coalescing (?? ) operators",
